  "description": "<p><strong>Brand introduction:</strong><br>AQUASTRONG is a trusted leader in water management solutions, offering high-performance pumps for residential, commercial, and industrial applications. Our products are designed to enhance efficiency, reduce energy consumption, and ensure reliability in water circulation, drainage, and filtration.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Product description:</strong><br>AQUASTRONG offers a wide range of pumps, including pool pumps, sewage pumps, sump pumps, and condensate pumps. Our products are built for durability, efficiency, and low maintenance, making them ideal for use in pools, basements, HVAC systems, and flood prevention applications. Each pump is engineered for seamless operation and maximum performance.</p>\r\n<p><strong>USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong><br>AQUASTRONG delivers advanced, energy-efficient pump solutions designed to meet various water management needs, with a focus on sustainability and top-tier performance. Our pumps come with easy installation, minimal maintenance, and exceptional customer support.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Payment terms:</strong><br>We accept major credit cards, PayPal, and other secure payment options. Payment is due at the time of purchase. For bulk or custom orders, we offer flexible payment terms, including upfront payments or invoicing options.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Other information:</strong><br>AQUASTRONG products are backed by a two-year warranty and reliable customer service. We offer fast, secure shipping, and our team is available to assist with product selection, installation guidance, and after-sales support.</p>",
